<title>USA: Fed says overnight system RPs added $4.950 billion.</title>
<headline>Fed says overnight system RPs added $4.950 billion.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added a total of $4.950 billion in overnight reserves to the banking system Thursday morning, the Federal Reserve Bank of New York confirmed.</p>
<p>(( --N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660 ))</p>
</text>
